다.","en_US":"Tower Dives in particular are extremely high tension moments, and therefore tower dive kills grant multiplicatively more points.","zh_CN":"塔殺是最緊張刺激的時刻，因此塔殺會獲得多倍的分數。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/24/0/3","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/24/0/3","label":{"ko_KR":"기준치 재조정","en_US":"Threshold Recalibration","zh_CN":"門檻重新調整"},"section":"stats","before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"이번 조정으로 포인트의 생성량이 크게 변경되는 만큼, 새로운 예상 수치에 맞춰 탐식 형태와 파멸 형태가 결정되는 기준이 재조정됩니다.","en_US":"Because these adjustments change point values significantly, we are adjusting the Voracious vs Ruinous threshold to try to better match these new expected values.","zh_CN":"由於這些調整大幅改變了分數值，我們也重新調整了貪食和毀滅型態的門檻，配合這些新的預期數值設計。"},"impact":"adjustment"}],"impact":"adjustment"}],"reviewCount":5,"officialSource":{"urls":{"ko_KR":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/patch-25-04-notes/","en_US":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/news/game-updates/patch-25-04-notes/","zh_CN":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/zh-tw/news/game-updates/patch-25-04-notes/"},"hashes":{"ko_KR":"5b10baaca07c45ef8f4c3b273a8c038c816d4d4ddaeef895674f2dd90ec7713a","en_US":"7e68a2ed638ad5e4e24f3ba941dfd774554676b8cfaa0fa73ca21c91aa96f5f8","zh_CN":"d42491e7f8be2e3891420792ca32e5189fbea479ed74ec41694a63a82ad0f04a"},"rowCount":49}}